{
 "schema": 1,
 "about": "Modwerk's Digitone mk1 base for OS 1.43 and 1.44 (interface 2.2, sdk/digitone/core/interface.json), built by scripts/elemod-base.mjs from Modwerk's October core (sdk/elemod/core) and this folder. It owns the boot, the twelve events, the three parameter slots of core_params, the mod pages of core_pages, the project data list of core_projdata, the Mod Menu of core_menu and the output owner of core_audio. A value given per OS ({\"1.43\": ..., \"1.44\": ...}) differs between the two. Sites name the stock bytes they displace by length and SHA-256 only; every displaced instruction is re-authored in the sources. Project save and new project hook the calls of the stock routines, never their entries, so a module may patch those.",
